# Client app config: holds APP_API_KEY for the browser. NEVER commit it —
# it is injected at deploy time by the GitHub Actions workflow from a repo
# secret (APP_CLIENT_KEY). Local dev without this file sends '' and the API
# accepts it (dev fallback in validateApiKey.js).
app-config.json
api/.admin-dashboard-preview-settings.json
student list.csv
/reference books PDFs

